["desc"] = "This WeakAura provides stat priority recommendations based on the player's class, specialization, and active hero talent. It uses data from external sources like Archon.gg and WoWhead and dynamically determines the best stat prioritization for a given setup.\n\nHere's how it works:\nIt retrieves the player's class, specialization, and hero talent selection.\nIf the user has a custom stat priority configured, it returns that instead.\nIt then references a predefined table containing stat priorities for different classes and specs, factoring in hero talents.\nThe script formats the output with color-coded text to keep the class fantasy theme.\nIf no matching entry is found, it returns an error message indicating an unsupported setup.\nThis script is useful for players who want a quick stat reference in-game without having to manually look up external resources.\nLegend:\n[R] - Indicates this stat priority is for Raiding.\n\n[M] - Indicates this stat priority is for Mythic+.\n\n[R/M] - Indicates this stat priority is both Raiding and Mythic+\n\n[S] - Indicates this stat priority was obtained from wowhead as a supplemental spec.",
